          <ul>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Choose a focus area and gather artifacts.</li><br>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Predicting the future: 1) Make an initial prediction about the future 2) Use AI to generate a prediction, then refine its prediction.</li><br>
       <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Exchange feedback with a peer.
      </li><br>
      <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Choose your audience and creative format for your final product.
      </li>
</ul>
