            <ul>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Analyze AI's prediction for accuracy and bias.</li><br>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Develop and refine your final product with the help of AI.
</li><br>
<li style="font-size: 14pt;">Get peer feedback on your product.
</li>
</ul>
