        <div style="flex: 1; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
            <h3><b>Day 3: Finalize Project </b></h3>
            <ul>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Finalize your product.</li><br>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Present your prediction in a Gallery Walk.</li><br>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Discuss and respond to feedback from your peers.</li><br>
